B.Zj=s(["Download originals or 640px, 1280px, and 1920px derivatives when available.","Long-press result cards, select any subset or all loaded files, and export originals or 1280px web-optimized media as ZIP files.","Track, cancel, and run multiple downloads while large selections are split into manageable archive parts.","Receive a data.csv manifest with every bulk ZIP, including source URLs, descriptions, dimensions, rights, attribution, dates, categories, assessments, and coordinates."],t.s)
B.akt=new A.lD("DOWNLOADS & DATA EXPORT","Move from discovery to a reusable media collection entirely in the browser.",B.Zj)
B.a_A=s(["Start from text, categories, depicted subjects, Wikidata statements, templates, geosearch, author uploads, or a related file.","Filter license, quality, format, resolution, size, color depth, dates, language, and excluded terms.","Combine branches with query constraints, union, intersection, or difference; then deduplicate, sort, sample, select fields, or enrich metadata.","Export large filtered datasets as CSV manifests containing metadata and direct media URLs, with optional Python download helper.","Preview intermediate results and send smaller outputs to JSON, ZIP, a media preview, or the main Search grid.","Autosave pipelines in IndexedDB, reopen saved graphs, import or export portable JSON, preview capped runs, cache queries, and clear cached results."],t.s)
B.aky=new A.lD("VISUAL DATA PIPELINES","Create repeatable, no-code Wikimedia research and export workflows on a node canvas.",B.a_A)
B.a03=s(["Use clean deep links for searches, assets, authors, maps, directories, pipelines, and this feature guide.","Install CommonsLens as a standalone web app on supported devices and use desktop or mobile-specific layouts.","Benefit from lazy metadata loading, staggered result rendering, request deduplication, Wikimedia-aware throttling, retries, and cancellable transfers.","No Commons account is required, and CommonsLens does not host or claim ownership of the media it displays."],t.s)
